---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const contactEnabled = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_CONTACT_FORM_ENABLED === 'true' && Boolean(import.meta.env.PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY);
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy — MAGNESS Software Consulting" description="How MAGNESS handles information submitted through the project enquiry form.">
  <article class="prose container">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p>{contactEnabled ? 'The project enquiry form asks for your name, email address, an optional company name, and a description of your project. MAGNESS uses this information to respond to your enquiry and discuss potential work with you.' : 'The project enquiry form is not currently available. When it is enabled, it will ask for your name, email address, an optional company name, and a description of your project. MAGNESS will use this information to respond to your enquiry and discuss potential work with you.'}</p>
    <h2>Sending your enquiry</h2>
    <p>Enquiries are delivered by email using Resend. Your submission is shared with that service and the email service used by MAGNESS to receive it. Please don’t include passwords, payment details, or confidential documents in the form.</p>
    <h2>Protecting the form</h2>
    <p>The server temporarily uses your network address to limit repeated submissions. Cloudflare Turnstile checks submissions for spam and may process device and network information as described in <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">Cloudflare’s privacy policy</a>. The website does not currently use advertising trackers or analytics cookies.</p>
    <h2>Your information</h2>
    <p>Submitting an enquiry does not subscribe you to marketing emails. To ask about information you’ve provided, including correction or deletion, reply to your correspondence with MAGNESS.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
